title: Public Health Service Reconstruction
subtitle: Begin with a rebuilt universal service; emergency staffing money is a fallback, not a first rung.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_major_reform_card
frequency: 130
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_health_reform_timer <= 0 and health_reform_settled = 0 and health_on_slate = 1 and reform_pressure_pending = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.poland_health_reform_timer = 3;
Q.health_reform_next_stage = Number(Q.health_reform_proposal_stage) || 4;
const thresholds = [0, 24, 40, 58, 80];
Q.health_reform_threshold = thresholds[Q.health_reform_next_stage];
const ministryBonus =
    (Q.health_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 12 : 0) +
    (Q.finance_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 7 : 0);
const koCabinet = Q.government_party == "ko" || Q.ministry_ko_in_cabinet;
const pslCabinet = Q.government_party == "psl" || Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet;
const p2050Cabinet =
    Q.government_party == "p2050" || Q.ministry_p2050_in_cabinet;
const thirdWayCabinet = pslCabinet || p2050Cabinet;
let partnerBonus = 0;
if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
    partnerBonus =
        Number(Q.pis_relation) * 0.14 +
        Number(Q.pis_accept_social) * 0.12 +
        Number(Q.health_pis_commitment) * 7 +
        Number(Q.pis_solidarist_share) * 0.10 -
        Number(Q.pis_market_hardliner_share) * 0.06;
} else {
    partnerBonus =
        (koCabinet
            ? Number(Q.ko_relation) * 0.08 +
                Number(Q.ko_accept_social) * 0.10 +
                Number(Q.health_ko_commitment) * 6 -
                Math.max(
                    0, Number(Q.ko_classical_liberal_share) - 40
                ) * 0.18
            : 0) +
        (thirdWayCabinet
            ? Number(Q.health_third_way_commitment) * 5 +
                (p2050Cabinet
                    ? Number(Q.p2050_state_capacity_share) * 0.06
                    : 0)
            : 0);
}
const palaceBonus =
    Number(Q.president_relation) * 0.05 +
    (Q.health_palace_president == Q.president_name
        ? Number(Q.health_palace_commitment) * 5
        : 0);
const publicBonus =
    (Number(Q.social_spending_support) - 40) * 0.26 +
    (Number(Q.vaccination_support) - 45) * 0.18 +
    Number(Q.public_sector_support) * 0.08 +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_poll) - 5) * 0.50;
Q.health_reform_power = Math.round(Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        140,
        Number(Q.health_reform_progress) * 0.62 +
        partnerBonus + palaceBonus + publicBonus + ministryBonus -
        Number(Q.eu_progressive_headwind) * 0.5
    )
));
Q.reform_ceiling_issue = "health";
Q.reform_ceiling_target = Q.health_reform_next_stage;
!}
call: poland_reform_ceiling
card-image: img/poland/cards/health-compact.webp

= The health service as a whole-game project

**Campaign goal:** [? if health_reform_defined: [+ health_reform_goal_label
+].?][? if not health_reform_defined: Not yet defined.?]
[? if health_reform_defined: **Bill currently on the table:** [+
health_reform_next_label +].
**Passage power:** **[+ health_reform_power +]**; tabling this bill needs **[+
health_reform_threshold +]**.
**Settlement ceiling:** [+ reform_ceiling_tier_label +] — [+
reform_ceiling_reachable_label +].
[? if reform_ceiling_blocker_kind != "none": Binding veto player: **[+
reform_ceiling_blocker_name +]** — scores the bill [+
reform_ceiling_blocker_score +] against the [+ reform_ceiling_need +] a tier-[+
reform_ceiling_target_resolved +] settlement needs.?]
[+ reform_ceiling_breakdown +].?][? if not health_reform_defined: The first
project action must define the ambitious bill before preparation or bargaining
can begin.?]

Everybody agrees the queue is intolerable. The disagreement is whether the
answer is more public capacity or a private lane for those who can pay, and
that is a coalition argument rather than a public one.

[? if government_party != "pis": KO's market wing will fund waiting-list money
and fight the clause that closes private lanes. That clause is the difference
between tier 3 and tier 4.?][? if government_party = "pis": PiS's solidarists
will spend on health; its market wing protects the private providers that grew
under their own government.?]

[? if health_minister_party = "Lewica": The Health Ministry supplies staffing
plans, contracts and a delivery map. It is a large advantage and not a
substitute for coalition votes.?]

- @define_goal
- @draft
- @coalition_round
- @cash_relation
- @ministry
- @palace
- @advance

@define_goal
title: Define the goal as a rebuilt universal health service
subtitle: Public financing, primary and psychiatric care and closed private lanes enter as one demand.
view-if: health_reform_defined = 0
on-arrival: health_reform_defined = 1; health_on_slate = 1; health_reform_goal_stage = 4; health_reform_proposal_stage = 4; health_reform_next_stage = 4; health_reform_progress += 12; labor_credibility += 2; public_sector_support += 3; news_headline = "Lewica defines a rebuilt universal health service as its social bill"

Naming the endpoint stops the coalition from presenting one year of
waiting-list money as the reconstruction.

- #poland_card_finish

@draft
title: Keep the clinicians, nurses and health economists drafting
subtitle: Free. Preparation +10.
view-if: health_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: health_reform_progress += 10; public_sector_support += 1; news_headline = "Lewica keeps its health-reconstruction statute ready for the next opening"

Nurses, GPs, psychiatrists and health economists turn the queue into staffing
numbers, tariffs and a financing path.

- #poland_card_finish

@coalition_round
title: Put the health file on a partner's table
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Choose KO, [+ third_way_display_name +] or PiS and record one commitment.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A serious negotiating round needs one resource.
view-if: health_reform_defined = 1
new-page: true

- @round_ko
- @round_third_way
- @round_pis

@round_ko
title: Ask KO to record a public-financing floor
on-arrival: resources -= 1; health_reform_progress += 8; health_ko_commitment += 1; ko_relation += 4; news_headline = "KO records a public health-financing floor"

KO records a public-financing floor beneath the health system. Private
provision is untouched, and the argument about whether the state should keep
retreating from it is closed for this parliament.

- #poland_card_finish

@round_third_way
title: Make [+ third_way_display_name +] name the capacity it would fund
view-if: p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1
on-arrival: {! Q.resources -= 1; Q.health_reform_progress += 8; Q.health_third_way_commitment += 1; Q.psl_relation += 4; Q.p2050_relation += 4; Q.news_headline = Q.third_way_display_name + " records public health capacity commitments"; !}

[+ third_way_display_name +] names the capacity it will fund — beds, staff and
county hospitals rather than a percentage of GDP. Its rural members can defend
a ward in a way no national ratio has ever survived.

- #poland_card_finish

@round_pis
title: Build the social-solidarist health channel in PiS
choose-if: (left_in_government = 1 and government_party = "pis") or pis_relation >= 15 or pis_negotiation_hostility_relief >= 5 or national_crisis_pressure >= 25
unavailable-subtitle: PiS will not record a health pledge without coalition ties, an established channel or national pressure.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; health_reform_progress += 8; health_pis_commitment += 1; pis_relation += 4; pis_solidarist_share += 2; news_headline = "PiS solidarists record support for public health capacity"

The solidarist wing of PiS has always been more comfortable with public health
than with public anything else. The pledge is real, and it strengthens exactly
the faction Lewica needs to stay strong inside that party.

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_relation
title: Cash in a party relationship instead of spending a resource
subtitle: Choose a 55+ relationship; it falls by 10 and becomes one recorded commitment.
choose-if: ko_relation >= 55 or pis_relation >= 55 or ((p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1) and (psl_relation >= 55 or p2050_relation >= 55))
unavailable-subtitle: No potential governing partner trusts us enough yet.
view-if: health_reform_defined = 1
new-page: true

- @cash_ko
- @cash_third_way
- @cash_pis

@cash_ko
title: Spend KO goodwill on public health financing
choose-if: ko_relation >= 55
on-arrival: ko_relation -= 10; health_ko_commitment += 1; health_reform_progress += 10; news_headline = "Lewica converts KO goodwill into public health financing"

The trust converts into financing rather than another joint declaration about
waiting lists. KO's leadership will be harder to reach next month.

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_third_way
title: Spend [+ third_way_display_name +] goodwill on health capacity
view-if: p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1
choose-if: psl_relation >= 55 or p2050_relation >= 55
on-arrival: {!
if (Number(Q.psl_relation) >= Number(Q.p2050_relation)) {
    Q.psl_relation -= 10;
} else {
    Q.p2050_relation -= 10;
}
Q.health_third_way_commitment += 1;
Q.health_reform_progress += 10;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica converts " + Q.third_way_display_name + " goodwill into health capacity";
!}

[+ third_way_display_name +] spends its goodwill on capacity in the places
where a closed ward is a local political event. The relationship pays for
staff, not for a slogan.

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_pis
title: Spend PiS goodwill on public health capacity
choose-if: pis_relation >= 55
on-arrival: pis_relation -= 10; health_pis_commitment += 1; health_reform_progress += 10; news_headline = "Lewica converts PiS goodwill into public health capacity"

PiS solidarists take the credit and Lewica takes the commitment. Both are
right, and the public system gains the votes it was short of.

- #poland_card_finish

@ministry
title: Make the Health Ministry produce the staffing and financing file
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. Preparation +14.
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and budget >= 1 and (health_minister_party = "Lewica" or finance_minister_party = "Lewica")
unavailable-subtitle: Requires the Health or Finance portfolio and one budget point.
view-if: health_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; health_reform_progress += 14; administrative_capacity += 2; government_delivery += 2; public_sector_support += 2; news_headline = "The Health Ministry maps staffing, tariffs and the financing path"

Every region receives posts, tariffs and dates. The private-lane clause stops
being ideological and becomes a line in a financing table.

- #poland_card_finish

@palace
title: Put the health financing file before the President
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Presidential commitment +1; preparation +6.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Palace delegation needs one resource.
view-if: health_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
if (Q.health_palace_president != Q.president_name) {
    Q.health_palace_commitment = 0;
    Q.health_palace_president = Q.president_name;
}
Q.health_palace_commitment += 1;
Q.health_reform_progress += 6;
Q.president_relation += 3;
Q.news_headline = "The Palace receives the health financing and staffing protocol";
!}

A veto on waiting lists is politically expensive, which is why the Palace tends
to have real room here — up to the point where the bill raises public financing
against private providers.

- #poland_card_finish

@advance
title: Table the bill: [+ health_reform_next_label +]
subtitle: Requires government and passage power at or above the displayed threshold; veto players may force a narrower final settlement.
view-if: health_reform_defined = 1
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and health_reform_power >= health_reform_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: We either lack executive access or have not assembled enough coalition and implementation power.
on-arrival: reform_pressure_issue = "health"; reform_pressure_target_stage = health_reform_proposal_stage; reform_pressure_previous_stage = 0; reform_pressure_return_mode = "card"; reform_pressure_palace_override = 0; reform_pressure_referendum_used = 0
go-to: poland_major_reforms.resolve
